cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite the preprint."
title: "Forecasters and the Freshness of Published Information in Wastewater Surveillance — replication package"
type: dataset
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Fujimura
    given-names: Ko
    email: fujimura@otsuma.ac.jp
    affiliation: "Otsuma Women's University, Faculty of Social Information Studies"
abstract: >-
  Code, analysis outputs and the complete research record of a study conducted autonomously by an
  AI research agent (OpenAI Codex), which compared pretrained time-series forecasters fed older
  actually published wastewater surveillance data with classical forecasters fed the latest data,
  using the public publication histories of Germany's AMELAG and New Zealand's wastewater data.
keywords:
  - wastewater surveillance
  - real-time forecasting
  - data vintages
  - time-series foundation models
  - forecast evaluation
  - AI-conducted research
